    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brominion is a Twitch-chat interactive overlay strategy game. Turn your boring, lifeless desktop screen into a battle warzone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/3dda5f80763fbf7475efe91a18f0e6be.poster.avif?t=1750782315\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/3dda5f80763fbf7475efe91a18f0e6be.webm?t=1750782315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/3dda5f80763fbf7475efe91a18f0e6be.mp4?t=1750782315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your warband:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy minions from the shop, or high-roll them from the slot machine! Train an army of fire-breathing dragons or raise a horde of the undead to destroy your adversaries. Civilly, of course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/df50598540d6bd65e350b175ac3545f1.avif?t=1750782315\" width=375 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn spells:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spells are crucial in turning a battle in your favor. Conjure a fiery Meteor from the heavens, bring down enemy flyers with a deadly Tornado, or melt them down with an Acid Rain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/29225942b889c82c45bacb77bf60d563.avif?t=1750782315\" width=199 height=227 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat bosses:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn extra rewards when you defeat the bosses. Beware, they are not easy to beat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twitch compatibility:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/b9e00b0994ee8869e2e675b452ce90ec.avif?t=1750782315\" width=86 height=84 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/Twitch.png?t=1750782315\" width=86 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brominion is also integrated for live broadcasters on Twitch. In fact, it was designed to add endless hours of interactivity for your Twitch community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the chat, viewers can farm resources to <u>build an army</u>, <u>hunt monsters</u> and even <u>duel other viewers</u>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with fully-customizable UI overlay and game settings, Brominion aims to provide endless hours of fun to any type of stream. Host a session of Brominion for your Twitch community, or play it offline while completing other tasks on your desktop!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brominion is a Twitch-chat interactive overlay strategy game. Turn your boring, lifeless desktop screen into a battle warzone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/3dda5f80763fbf7475efe91a18f0e6be.poster.avif?t=1750782315\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/3dda5f80763fbf7475efe91a18f0e6be.webm?t=1750782315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/3dda5f80763fbf7475efe91a18f0e6be.mp4?t=1750782315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your warband:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy minions from the shop, or high-roll them from the slot machine! Train an army of fire-breathing dragons or raise a horde of the undead to destroy your adversaries. Civilly, of course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/df50598540d6bd65e350b175ac3545f1.avif?t=1750782315\" width=375 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn spells:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spells are crucial in turning a battle in your favor. Conjure a fiery Meteor from the heavens, bring down enemy flyers with a deadly Tornado, or melt them down with an Acid Rain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/29225942b889c82c45bacb77bf60d563.avif?t=1750782315\" width=199 height=227 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat bosses:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn extra rewards when you defeat the bosses. Beware, they are not easy to beat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twitch compatibility:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/b9e00b0994ee8869e2e675b452ce90ec.avif?t=1750782315\" width=86 height=84 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505330/extras/Twitch.png?t=1750782315\" width=86 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brominion is also integrated for live broadcasters on Twitch. In fact, it was designed to add endless hours of interactivity for your Twitch community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the chat, viewers can farm resources to <u>build an army</u>, <u>hunt monsters</u> and even <u>duel other viewers</u>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with fully-customizable UI overlay and game settings, Brominion aims to provide endless hours of fun to any type of stream. Host a session of Brominion for your Twitch community, or play it offline while completing other tasks on your desktop!</p>",
